    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Learned Deputy Advocate General has placed on record the instructions dated 15th May, 2023,\nwhich go to indicate that only on account of the post of LAO Shimla being vacant, necessary papers could not be processed for further issuance of notification under Section 19 of The Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013.\nGiven the fact that the notification under Section 11 of the Act is likely to lapse, it is high time that the State initiates steps for filling up the post of LAO atleast within a period of two weeks from today.",
